  "prompt": "How did the website's visitors of March 2025 move through the signup funnel? Take the visitors with at least one session that started in March 2025 (session_start, a UTC instant, read in UTC). Of those, a visitor counts as signed up when the visitor's signup (signups.visitor_id) also happened in March 2025, in UTC, and as activated when that user has a first_campaign_sent event at any time. A visitor has at most one signup. Return three columns, in this order: visitors, signed_up and activated, each a number of visitors. Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "visitors",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "signed_up",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "activated",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
